# Copy to samba.env (install.sh does it, and fills USER_1). Format "name;password;uid;group;gid": install.sh asks the
# name (WPKG_SAMBA_USER, default administrateur) and takes the uid and the gid of the owner of services/samba/share;
# the group must be wpkg, which smb.conf lets in (valid users = @wpkg); letters and digits only in the password.
USER_1=
